{"title": "Darkness (cloud)", "pageid": 39852, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)", "categories": ["Clouds", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Darkness_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Darkness_cloud.png/300px-Darkness_cloud.png.webp, /w/images/a/ad/Darkness_cloud.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Darkness (cloud) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Darkness_cloud.png/300px-Darkness_cloud.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Darkness_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Darkness</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloud\">cloud</a> that prevents creatures from seeing into or out of the cloud.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>A shroud of magical darkness that Heavily Obscures and Blinds creatures within. Creatures cannot make ranged attacks into or out of the darkness.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Blinded\"> Condition: Blinded </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. Range of attacks and spells reduced to 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>Attack Rolls against Blinded creatures have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Darkness\" title=\"Arrow of Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Darkness_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Arrow_of_Darkn